The effect of *Ulva lactuca* ethanol extract (100 µg mL⁻¹) is likely to **inhibit protein kinase A (PKA)** activity. This inhibition may occur via direct binding of bioactive compounds to PKA or by modulating cAMP levels. Further studies are needed to confirm the exact mechanism.",relevance,"# Task Description
