<USER_REQUEST>
What is the genetic basis and key characteristics of Huntington's disease?
</USER_REQUEST>

<GROUND_TRUTH>
Huntington's disease is an autosomal dominant disorder that results in the progressive destruction of brain cells. Key characteristics include:
